## 🔌 Circuit Wiring

```
5V  ──── LDR ──── A0 ──── 10kΩ ──── GND
                   |
              (reads here)

Pin 9 ──── 220Ω ──── LED(+) ──── LED(-) ──── GND
```

| Connection | Detail |
|---|---|
| LDR leg 1 | 5V |
| LDR leg 2 | A0 pin + 10kΩ resistor |
| 10kΩ other end | GND |
| LED long leg (+) | Pin 9 via 220Ω resistor |
| LED short leg (-) | GND |

